# Runtime data written by the running server. Written with relative
# paths, so these can appear at the repo root, or inside VertexClient/
# or VertexServer/ depending on where the jar/process is run from -
# ignored everywhere via **/.
#
# Player accounts, social data, and match history are private and stay
# local-only, never committed.
**/gamehub_*.dat

# Bug reports, general suggestions, and game suggestions are the
# exception: these are meant to flow back to the developer, so they're
# NOT ignored - commit and push these two specifically (e.g. before
# asking for a bug fix) so a fresh session can read them directly
# instead of you re-explaining each one by hand.
**/gamehub_*.txt
!**/gamehub_feedback.txt
!**/gamehub_gamesuggestions.txt

# Compiled output, if ever built into the tree instead of a scratch dir.
**/*.class
build/
out/

# OS/editor cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
